{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtNVmDKXZH1AJrwCCVA9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The decision point is clear from the tokenization. A bulleted line is \"\\n\", indent, \" *\", \"  \", then the first content word (\" Wait\" = 13428, \" So\" = 1987, \" Let\" = 6558). The hidden state at the token just before that word decides whether the new line opens a doubt. Next, I will count which first words start lines in the model's thinking, separately for finished samples and for the pre-loop part of cut samples. That defines a \"reflect\" class against a \"proceed/compute\" class with enough examples. If the reflect words are clearly over-represented in cut samples from early on, the line-start decision is where the failure lives and is the right place to look for a direction.\n\n```python\n# Which first words start lines in the thinking (pre-onset), and how do finished vs cut samples differ? Defines reflect vs proceed classes.\nfrom collections import Counter\nfw_re = re.compile(r'^[\\s*\\-\\d.)]*([A-Za-z\\']+)')\ncnt = {False: Counter(), True: Counter()}; nlines = {False: 0, True: 0}\nfor recs in (g1, g5o):\n    for r in recs:\n        for s in r['samples']:\n            t = s['text']; t = t[:t.find('</think>')] if '</think>' in t else t\n            if s['cut']:\n                ids = ids_of(t); p, on = tail_period(ids)\n                if on is None: continue\n                t = tok.decode(ids[:on].tolist())\n            for l in t.split('\\n'):\n                m_ = fw_re.match(l)\n                if m_ and len(l.strip()) > 3: cnt[s['cut']][m_.group(1)] += 1; nlines[s['cut']] += 1\ntop = [w for w, _ in (cnt[True] + cnt[False]).most_common(40)]\nprint('lines fin %d cut %d' % (nlines[False], nlines[True]))\nprint(' '.join(f'{w}:{1000*cnt[False][w]/nlines[False]:.0f}/{1000*cnt[True][w]/nlines[True]:.0f}' for w in top))\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3751,"cache_read_input_tokens":47311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3751},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bffdcda1-9f39-489f-baee-e490968ea481","uuid":"ed3f1c56-efbd-419b-a2c9-59fdfb83b972","timestamp":"2026-11-10T01:22:31.989Z","request_id":"req_011CgtNVktE6XV3zbtpCYJqz"}
